q                   2.HH33          R11N.HH33        T12N.HH33        # serial 76 NME A2.HH33

# Bond changes:
# formed: 1-10 (PAF.N2 -- ENL.C10); pAF amino N to enal carbonyl C; N-C bond formation
# weakened: 10-16 (ENL.C10 -- ENL.O1); enal C=O pi bond weakens as alkoxide forms
